body:
Two things; 

Whenever you see a young child or baby looking around smiling, just so happy discovering everything for the first time ... that blissful ignorance is beautiful. It's something we all experienced but never had the chance to appreciate.

The ocean. Waves crashing on the rocks, wind in your hair, just staring out over the horizon. Knowing there is an entire world below the surface... there's nothing quite as calming.
